  "body_markdown": "Skip to content\n\nCall or Text Us: (310) 954-9449\n\nRequest An Appointment\n\nPatient Registration\n\nHome\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Team\n\nDr. Jonathan Shadi\n\nDr. Saman Vahedi\n\nOur Technology\n\nCone Beam 3D Imaging\n\nProcedures\n\nOral Surgery\n\nBone Grafting\n\nPre-Prosthetic Surgery\n\nPlatelet Rich Fibrin (PRF)\n\nOral Pathology\n\nOrthognathic (Corrective Jaw) Surgery\n\nDental Implants\n\nRestorative Dentistry\n\nFull Mouth Reconstruction\n\nImpacted Canines\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\nEmergency Dentistry\n\nFacial Trauma Fractures\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nPatient Center\n\nPatient Information\n\nInsurance & Finance\n\nAreas We Serve\n\nMar Vista\n\nPalms\n\nCulver City\n\nWestwood\n\nSawtelle\n\nCentury City\n\nBrentwood\n\nSanta Monica\n\nWest Los Angeles\n\nSurgical Instructions\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nOral Surgery Pre-Operative Instructions\n\nPost-Operative Instructions\n\nReferring Doctors\n\nBlogs\n\nContact Us\n\nWelcome To\n\n\n# Wilshire Oral Surgery and Implant Center\n\n\n\n## The Needs Of The Patient Come First\n\n\nWilshire Oral Surgery and Implant Center is LA’s premier state-of-the-art oral and maxillofacial surgery practice located in one of LA’s most iconic neighborhoods. We are proud to provide personalized full-scope oral and maxillofacial surgery for patients utilizing today’s most modern surgical diagnostic and treatment technologies.\n\nOur board-certified surgeons and staff have extensive training and experience in surgical procedures including dental implants, wisdom teeth removal, IV sedation and general anesthesia, impacted teeth, facial/dental trauma, “teeth in a day” surgery, and many other contemporary oral surgery & implant services. We focus on the needs of each patient to provide a comfortable experience in a relaxing and modern environment in our West Los Angeles office.\n\nLearn More\n\n\n## Our Team\n\n\nRead More\n\n\n### Dr. Jonathan Shadi\n\n\n\n### Dr. Saman Vahedi\n\n\nWhat We Offer\n\n\n## Our Featured Services\n\n\n\n### Bone Grafting\n\n\n\n### ​​​​​​​Cone-beam 3D Imaging\n\n\n\n### ​​​​​​​Dental Implants\n\n\n\n### ​​​​​​​Facial Trauma/Fractures\n\n\n\n### ​​​​​​​Full Mouth Reconstruction\n\n\n\n### ​​​​​​​Impacted Canines\n\n\n\n### ​​​​​​​IV Sedation/General Anesthesia\n\n\n\n### ​​​​​​​Oral Pathology/Biopsies\n\n\n\n### ​​​​​​​Orthognathic Surgery\n\n\n\n### ​​​​​​​Platelet Rich Fibrin (PRF)/Growth Factors\n\n\n\n### ​​​​​​​Pre-Prosthetic Surgery\n\n\n\n### Wisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\nWhat To Expect\n\n\n### Patient Registration\n\n\nSave time during your visit by downloading and filling out our patient registration form. Patients who have registered online may arrive 5 to 10 minutes before their scheduled appointment. Patients who have not, should arrive no less than 20 minutes early to complete the patient paperwork in office.\n\n\n### Insurance\n\n\nWe work hand-in-hand to maximize your insurance benefits. We make every effort to provide you with the finest care and the most convenient financial options and will call your insurance, on your behalf, to calculate the most accurate estimate. We are participating providers for most insurance companies and work hand-in-hand with you to maximize your insurance reimbursement for covered procedures.\n\n\n### Length Of Procedure\n\n\nThe length of your procedure will depend on the procedure taking place. Wisdom teeth procedures typically take 30 to 60 minutes. Single tooth extractions usually take 20-30 minutes. Implant and bone grafting procedures can vary. You can expect to be in our office 1.5 to 2 hours which accounts for initial paperwork, consultation, procedure, and in-office recovery time.\n\nOver 300 5-Star Reviews\n\n\n## Patient Testimonials\n\n\nDr Vahedi was great. I had my two sons have their wisdom teeth removed. Both sons 17 and 21 had minor pain after the surgery. Very professional and answered all ur questions. Highly recommend. The staff Stephanie and Andria I think were fantastic, very helpful and answered all ur questions.\n\nBY David D.\n\nDr. Vahedi removed my 8-year old’s supernumerary tooth yesterday, and so far we are very pleased with the result and the overall process. All the staff were very professional, from the front desk to the nurses to Dr. Vahedi. They helped my daughter feel comfortable in what would otherwise be a very stressful process for a child. Thank you!\n\nBY Rebecca C.\n\nI was given a referral from my dentist to see Dr. Shadi. I didn’t know what to expect at first because of where his office was, 23 miles from my home. I was reluctant at first because of the travel distance but after meeting the office and Dr. Shadi for the first time, I had no second thoughts and scheduled my appointment for an Implant. Both the staff and Doctor were very professional. The implant was a success with zero complications. I would truly recommend Wilshire Oral Surgery for your dental needs. Thank you Doc!\n\nBY John E.\n\nEverything was explained. All treatment options. What to expect during procedure and recovery. Staff very helpful. Very clean and modern offices. I would highly recommend\n\nBY Bryan B.\n\nThe office gave my daughter an appointment with within a very reasonable time. On day of appointment they saw her on time, explained the procedure and after are in detail. All staff including the dentist were extremely empathetic and supportive of my daughter. Surgeon personally called and followed up with us after she had her wisdom teeth pulled. Everyone was extremely sweet and compassionate to our needs. Will recommend this office to others.\n\nBY Vanessa G.\n\nHad all of my wisdom teeth extracted at once here. The cost was affordable (compared to competitors) and the surgery was only around 30 minutes. I opted for PRF which greatly helped the healing process – I healed in about 4-5 days. Can’t recommend them enough, they have such a friendly group of office staff and surgeons.\n\nBY Sabrina C.\n\n\n## Our Reviews\n\n\n\n## Contact Us\n\n\nThe first step toward achieving a beautiful, healthy smile is to schedule an appointment. To schedule an appointment, please complete and submit the request form below.\n\nFirst Name\n\nLast Name\n\nEmail\n\nPhone\n\nInsurance Name\n\nInsurance ID or SSN\n\nSubject\n\nDate of Birth\n\nAppointment Date\n\nPreferred Time\n\nMessage\n\nUpload Insurance Card Photo\n\nSend\n\nOur Service Area\n\n\n## Serving the Westside of Los Angeles\n\n\nOur office at 12300 Wilshire Blvd is minutes from nine Westside communities. Select your neighborhood to learn more.\n\nOn-site · 0 mi\n\n10–15 min east on Wilshire\n\n5–10 min via Wilshire or Sunset\n\n5–10 min via Wilshire Blvd\n\nUnder 10 min via Wilshire Blvd\n\n5 min via Wilshire or SM Blvd\n\n10–15 min via Venice or I-10\n\n10–15 min via Venice Blvd\n\n10 min via National or I-10\n\nView All Areas We Serve\n\n\n### Contact Information\n\n\n12300 Wilshire Blvd #326 Los Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 954-9449\n\n\n### Hours of Operation\n\n\nMonday\n\n8:00am – 4:00pm\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nClosed\n\nSunday\n\n© 2026 Wilshire Oral Surgery and Implant Center. All Rights Reserved.\n\nAccessibility Statement\n\nMEET US\n\nSurgical Instructio...\n\nBlog\n\nMeet Us\n\nPatient Registration Form\n\nPre-prosthetic Surgery\n\nOral Surgery Pre-operative Instructions\n\nIV Sedation / General Anesthesia\n\nPost-operative Instructions",
